  "title": "Habits",
  "summary": "Build habits with reminders, streaks and a checklist on your home screen.",
  "description": "Pick the habits you want to keep and how often: every day, on weekdays or on the days you choose. Tick a habit off in the app, from its reminder or from the home-screen checklist, and watch the streak grow.\n\n- **Reminders** at the time you set for each habit, with a Done button.\n- **Streaks** that follow each habit's own schedule.\n- **A checklist widget** for today's habits.\n\n**What it never does:** no ads, no tracking and no account. Your habits stay on this phone.",
  "license": "MIT",
